# Keep the build context small and deterministic.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/TestResults/
**/App_Data/
.git/
.github/
docs/
deploy/
tests/
web/dashboard/node_modules/
samples/browser/node_modules/

# wwwroot is NOT ignored: CI builds the dashboard and the browser sample before the image, and
# `dotnet publish` picks them up from there.
